    "text": "Before we start\nThis book shares my personal experience and education for general information. It is not medical\nadvice, and I am not a doctor, dietitian, or therapist. Consult a qualified physician before\nbeginning this or any diet or exercise program, especially if you have any medical condition, take\nany medication, are under 18, or are pregnant or nursing. This program is designed for adults.\nNever eat below the intake floors stated in Chapter 2. If you have a history of disordered eating,\nwork with a professional instead of following this program. By using this book you accept full\nresponsibility for your own health decisions.",
