    "pageType": "text",
    "text": "READ THIS FIRST\nRead This First: The Deal\nBefore my story. Before the math. Before anything. You need to know the deal you just bought\ninto.\nFollow this program for 90 days. If you don't lose at least 10 pounds, I pay you back\nDOUBLE what you paid for this book.\nFor that to be possible, this program runs on one thing: consistency of tracking. Every day,\nyou'll log what you eat, photograph what you eat, log your steps, and log your morning weight.\nThat's the whole price of admission. It's also, not coincidentally, the exact thing that makes the\nfat come off. The proof and the results are the same actions.\nHere's what to do right now:\n1. Read this book today. It's short on purpose.\n2. Run your numbers in Chapter 2. Ten minutes with a calculator.\n3. Send your Day 1 email (Chapter 7 shows you exactly what goes in it). Your 90 days and your\nguarantee start the moment you send it.\nThe people who register Day 1 finish. The people who \"start Monday\" are still saying it next year.\nYou paid for this. Start the clock.\nFull guarantee terms are in Chapter 7. Everything between here and there exists to make sure I\nnever have to pay you.\nLet's go.",
