    "pageType": "text",
    "text": "What This Book Is\nThis is the program I wish someone had handed me at 22. Not four years of guessing. The\nstraight line:\n1. Calories. The whole game. This is the secret, and I'll prove it to you.\n2. Steps. Your daily fat burning floor.\n3. The gym. A simple program so you keep muscle and look lean, not just smaller.\nIn the next chapter, we're going to run your numbers: where you are, where you want to be, and\nexactly how many days it will take to get there, as fast as your body biologically allows.\nNo guessing. Not anymore.\nLet's go.",
