    "pageType": "text",
    "text": "CHAPTER 2\nChapter 2: Your Numbers\nYou can't hit a target you never aimed at. That was my mistake for four years. So before you\nchange a single meal, we're going to spend ten minutes with a calculator and get you four\nnumbers:\n1. Where you are\n2. Where you're going\n3. Your personal maximum speed\n4. Your exact timeline\nGrab a pen. This chapter is a worksheet. Fill it in as you read.\nStep 1: Where You Are\nYour weight: Step on a scale first thing in the morning, after the bathroom, before food or water.\nWrite it down.\nCurrent weight: ________ lbs\nYour body fat percentage: You don't need a fancy scan. Estimate it visually using the chart on\nthe next page: find your row, be honest.",
    "title": "Chapter 2: Your Numbers",
