    "pageType": "text",
    "text": "WHERE ARE YOU RIGHT NOW?\nLook in the mirror shirtless. Find your row. Be honest.\n10 to 14%\nLEAN\nAbs clearly visible. Veins may show on arms.\nFace looks sharp. Shirt comes off without a thought.\n15 to 19%\nATHLETIC\nFaint ab outline with some softness over it.\nLean in clothes. Looks fit at the beach.\nTHE GOAL: 15%\n20 to 24%\nSOFT\nNo abs visible. Some belly when sitting.\nLooks fine in clothes. This is skinny fat territory.\n25 to 30%\nOVERWEIGHT\nClear belly. Soft chest. Waistband folds over.\n25% is the medical line where obesity starts for men.\n31 to 40%+\nHIGH RISK\nLarge belly. Fat on chest and back.\nHealth risk rises sharply here. Start today.\nWHEN IN DOUBT, PICK THE HIGHER NUMBER.\nHonesty here means accuracy everywhere else in your plan.\nHere are the ranges in words. Look at yourself shirtless in the mirror and compare honestly:\n Abs clearly visible: 10 to 14%\n Faint ab outline, some softness: 15 to 19%\n No abs visible, some belly: 20 to 24%\n Clear belly, soft chest: 25 to 30%\n Large belly, fat on chest and back: 31 to 40%+\nWhen in doubt, pick the higher number. Honesty here means accuracy everywhere else.\nBody fat: ________ %",
    "title": "How to Lose Fat as Fast as Possible",
